                                                "sense_id": "07ab7788-c3bf-34ae-ba78-769b33b0dcfa",
                                                "text": "Toward the end of July, Vatanen took a forestry job. It meant billhooking and chopping excessive undergrowth from the woods on the sandy ridges around Kuhmo and living in a tent with an ever more faithful, almost full- grown hare."
